<%# Insurance and tax registration, demoted from the old bold boxed block to
    a single quiet line. Still present and verifiable, no longer shouted.

    NOTE: this is repeated per page rather than pinned to the bottom of the
    sheet, so on a short document it floats up under the content, and a page
    that overflows inherits no footer at all. The fix is wkhtmltopdf's
    --footer-html, which needs a change to GenerateQuote/GenerateReceipt —
    tracked as a follow-up, see .sdd/ENG-11/mockups/NOTES.md. %>
<% insurance = [organization.insurance_provider,
                organization.insurance_policy_number.present? ? "policy #{organization.insurance_policy_number}" : nil,
                organization.insurance_description].compact_blank %>

<table class='pdf-footer'>
  <tr>
    <td>
      <% if insurance.any? %>
        <span class='fl'>Insured with</span> <%= insurance.join(', ') %>
      <% end %>
      <% if organization.hst_number.present? %>
        &nbsp;&nbsp;<span class='fl'>HST</span> <%= organization.hst_number %>
      <% end %>
    </td>
    <td><%= estimate.quote_display_address %></td>
  </tr>
</table>
